{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f106db5d3e48c23969de35e7e73051209b85d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2, 3, 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> and 5 are each assigned to exactly one of the letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64e36e3b4923d8a3430bfb8debde692757a23dbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V, W, X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3a00f6f72dc9db263e66841aaab4be25af00f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y^{X} - W^{V}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"19\" /> the greatest possible value. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e61f81d72a201a67226bce757bdfaea41f97062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X + V$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/4/744813e9b381a8f78ba7586191db5a75cac5157e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To maximize the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3a00f6f72dc9db263e66841aaab4be25af00f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y^{X} - W^{V}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"19\" />, we can maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/d/01ddf7bbad1483043ba598c8fbd3ca6f44beae52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y^{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\" /> and minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec316952f364b377a10f1b0008afe62b4216857c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W^{V}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9c4d2b7a88e9f6459d8339edea171fa7d3e5f26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{4} = 625$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/d/2bd0694bad8d3b52c23cdfba7575dde38eeef84f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{5} = 1024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />, so we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/042f5bb72172a531ad08ece340f7e1575aaae7be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/f/b3fbbc632f18d767ad1d9e7af1fa841452c13a6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/d/01ddf7bbad1483043ba598c8fbd3ca6f44beae52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y^{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ffbc99e2825b6f4458b370bae99157e55a79e65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/3/cd32c9bea9ffacbf413f1030293c9a8091c4e4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, so we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/9/129a394e53ae5d9485467a5da722ed2d61c63077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W = 2$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/9/af98a434a9ece7696ea03664024089b06467f98a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec316952f364b377a10f1b0008afe62b4216857c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W^{V}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d58aa29201da09d8e620f8698e3a37547f6b4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea9426c185ff365fb903f72c2156fac15fbd2fcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)